OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency doctor 'completely
OL,4,Aterrified' of looming winter pressures
OL,5,Aon NHS
OL,6,
OL,7,FA leading emergency doctor has said she
OL,8,Fis "completely terrified" about
OL,9,Fupcoming winter pressures on Scotland's
OL,10,Falready-stretched NHS.
OL,12,FDr Fiona Hunter, vice chair of the
OL,13,FRoyal College of Emergency Medicine
OL,14,FScotland, said A&E departments were
OL,15,Fproviding "unsafe" levels of care, with
OL,16,Fsome patients spending 72 hours on
OL,17,Ftrolleys in hospital corridors.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
