OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency doctor 'completely
OL,4,Aterrified' of looming winter pressures
OL,5,Aon NHS
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlthough Health Secretary Angela
OL,8,FConstance vowed in August to
OL,9,F"eradicate" corridor care, Hunter told
OL,10,FBBC Scotland's The Sunday Show there
OL,11,Fhad been a "toxic normalisation" of
OL,12,Fthis practice which can lead to
OL,13,Fpatients dying.
OL,15,FConstance told the programme that the
OL,16,Fwinter would be "difficult" but
OL,17,Freiterated that corridor care was
OL,18,Funacceptable.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
